   "description": "When this unit is afflicted with a StatusEffect:\n- Cleanses itself & perform IchigoVasto_Skill4 for 150% of its damage\n- This attack hits all enemies in range & applies Stun for 3s\nCooldown: 5s"
  },
  {
   "name": "IchigoVastoPassive3",
   "display_name": "Go For The Heart",
   "unlock_upgrade": 11,
   "description": "When a Boss leaves this unit’s range:\n- This unit stops attacking and becomes a PathSummon, grabbing the Boss and dragging them along the path back to the closest spot on the track near this unit’s position (Global Cooldown: 30s)\n- The Boss takes 200% of this unit’s damage from the initial grab, guaranteed to crit\n- Every enemy hit by the PathSummon takes 150% of this unit’s damage\nMax application per Boss: 1"
  }
